     <property name="sets" value="oath_taken"/>
     <property name="text" value="He drank the most, and he drowned the first.\n\nSix blades were made and six were sworn, one to each house that set its ring to the deed. The oath was read aloud over the quench: that no power above a man would stand above the houses again, and that the blade would answer for the hand that broke faith.\n\nThey quenched them in blood rather than oil. This one still drinks that way.\n\nThe plate names a house and leaves the name off. Whoever carried him up here wanted the oath buried quietly, and went to some trouble to do it a long way from any road."/>
